Padosi jodo ko compare karo, galat kram ho to badal do — bade number bulbule ki tarah aakhir me pahunchte hain:

```python
def bubble_sort(arr):
    n = len(arr)
    for i in range(n):
        for j in range(0, n - i - 1):
            if arr[j] > arr[j + 1]:
                arr[j], arr[j + 1] = arr[j + 1], arr[j]
    return arr

print(bubble_sort([5, 2, 9, 1, 7]))   # [1, 2, 5, 7, 9]
```

Har chakkar me sabse bada bacha hua number aakhir me baith jata hai, isiliye andar wala loop har baar ek kam chalta hai (n - i - 1). Dheema hai (O(n²)) par samajhne ke liye best hai.

