Jod me neeche wale (denominator) ka LCM, phir GCD se chhota karo:

```python
import math

class Fraction:
    def __init__(self, upar, neeche):
        g = math.gcd(upar, neeche)
        self.upar = upar // g
        self.neeche = neeche // g

    def __add__(self, other):
        upar = self.upar * other.neeche + other.upar * self.neeche
        neeche = self.neeche * other.neeche
        return Fraction(upar, neeche)

    def __str__(self):
        return str(self.upar) + "/" + str(self.neeche)

print(Fraction(1, 4) + Fraction(1, 4))   # 1/2
print(Fraction(2, 3) + Fraction(1, 6))   # 5/6
print(Fraction(4, 8))                    # 1/2 (khud chhota ho gaya)
```

__init__ me hi simplify kar dene se har fraction hamesha apne sabse chhote roop me rehta hai — jod ka jawab bhi apne aap saaf.

