Factorial matlab 1 se 5 tak sab ka guna:

```c
#include <stdio.h>

int main() {
    int n = 5;
    long long fact = 1;
    for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) {
        fact = fact * i;
    }
    printf("%d ka factorial = %lld", n, fact);
    return 0;
}
```

Output: `5 ka factorial = 120`

- Hisab: 1 x 2 x 3 x 4 x 5 = 120
- `long long` liya hai kyunki factorial bahut jaldi bada ho jata hai — 13 ka factorial hi int me nahi samata

