Prime matlab sirf 1 aur khud se katne wala number:

```c
#include <stdio.h>

int main() {
    int n = 7, hai = 1;
    if (n < 2) hai = 0;
    for (int i = 2; i * i <= n; i++) {
        if (n % i == 0) { hai = 0; break; }
    }
