Bubble sort — padosi numbero ko badal-badal kar sahi jagah:

```c
#include <stdio.h>

int main() {
    int arr[] = {40, 10, 30, 20, 50};
    int n = 5;
    for (int i = 0; i < n - 1; i++) {
        for (int j = 0; j < n - 1 - i; j++) {
            if (arr[j] > arr[j + 1]) {
                int temp = arr[j];
                arr[j] = arr[j + 1];
                arr[j + 1] = temp;
            }
        }
    }
    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++)
        printf("%d ", arr[i]);
    return 0;
}
```

Output: `10 20 30 40 50`

- Har chakkar me sabse bada number bulbule (bubble) ki tarah aakhir me pahunch jata hai
- Adla-badli ke liye teesra dabba `temp` chahiye — bina iske ek value mit jayegi

