Ulta sutra: C = (F − 32) × 5/9

```c
#include <stdio.h>

int main() {
    float f = 98.6;
    float c = (f - 32) * 5 / 9;
    printf("%.1f Fahrenheit = %.1f Celsius", f, c);
    return 0;
}
```

Output: `98.6 Fahrenheit = 37.0 Celsius`

Koshthak (bracket) zaroori hai — pehle 32 ghatana hai, phir guna-bhaag. Bina koshthak ke hisaab ka kram badal jayega.

