goto program ko **uchhal kar** kisi label par bhej deta hai:

```c
#include <stdio.h>

int main() {
    int n = 5;
    if (n < 10)
        goto chhota;
    printf("Bada hai");
    return 0;
chhota:
    printf("Chhota hai");
    return 0;
}
```

Output: `Chhota hai`

Salah: **goto se bacho.** Isse program ka rasta ulajh jata hai — kahan se kahan uchhla, padhna mushkil (spaghetti code). Jo kaam goto karta hai, wo if, loop aur function se saaf tareeke se ho jata hai. Purane code me dikhe to samajh jao, naye me mat likho.

