Recursion matlab: koi method khud ko hi chhote sawal ke saath bulaye.

```java
static void ginati(int n) {
    if (n == 0) return;         // rukne ki shart
    System.out.println(n);
    ginati(n - 1);              // khud ko bulaya
}
```

`ginati(3)` bulane par 3, 2, 1 print hoga. Do cheezein hona lazmi hai: **rukne ki shart (base case)** aur **har baar sawal chhota hona**. Ek bhi chooki to method bulata rahega aur StackOverflowError aa jayega. Factorial aur Fibonacci recursion ke mashhoor example hain.

