Do tareekho ka farak dinon me:

```javascript
function gin() {
  let d1 = new Date(document.getElementById('d1').value);
  let d2 = new Date(document.getElementById('d2').value);
  let farak = Math.round((d2 - d1) / (1000 * 60 * 60 * 24));
  document.getElementById('out').textContent = 'Farak: ' + farak + ' din';
}
```

Do `Date` ghatao to millisecond me farak milta hai — use din ke millisecond (1000×60×60×24) se bhaag do. `Math.round` aadhe din wali ghadi-gadbad ko saaf karta hai.

Ek object = ek card:

```javascript
let saaman = [
  { naam: 'Juta', daam: 999, photo: 'juta.jpg' },
