Online dukaan ke saare page isi par bane hain — data server se aata hai, card yahan banta hai. Naya saaman matlab data me ek object aur, page ko chhuna hi nahi.

Ek jhanda (flag) aur wahi purani ghadi:

```javascript
let hai12 = true;
function badloFormat() { hai12 = !hai12; ghadi(); }
function ghadi() {
  let d = new Date();
  let h = d.getHours();
  let dikhana = hai12 ? (h % 12 || 12) : h;
  document.getElementById('time').textContent = dikhana + ':' + String(d.getMinutes()).padStart(2, '0');
}
```

`h % 12 || 12` — 0 aaye to 12 dikhao wala chhota roop hai. Ghadi har second khud chalti rahe, format badalna bas dikhawa badalta hai.

```javascript
let sheher = ['Delhi', 'Mumbai', 'Jaipur'];
sheher.splice(1, 1);              // 1 number se 1 item hataya
console.log(sheher);
sheher.splice(1, 0, 'Lucknow');      // 1 number par bina hataye joda
console.log(sheher);
```

`splice(shuru, kitneHataye, ...jodnaHai)` — teen kaam ek me: hatana, jodna, badalna (hatakar jodna). Ye asal list ko badalta hai, isliye hosh se use karo.

Har akshar ko vowel wali list se milao:

```javascript
function gin() {
  let t = document.getElementById('txt').value.toLowerCase();
  let c = 0;
  for (let ch of t) { if ('aeiou'.includes(ch)) c++; }
  document.getElementById('out').textContent = 'Vowel: ' + c;
}
