Pasand localStorage me rakhne se har baar button nahi dabana padta. Bade apps me bhi dark mode ki neev yahi class toggle hai — bas rang zyada hote hain.

Object ki har jaankari ko sahi jagah:

```javascript
let chhatra = { naam: 'Ravi', kaksha: 8, ank: { hindi: 80, ganit: 92, angrezi: 75 } };
let kul = chhatra.ank.hindi + chhatra.ank.ganit + chhatra.ank.angrezi;
