Object ke andar object (`ank`) bhi ho sakta hai — raasta dot se banta hai: `chhatra.ank.ganit`. Asli data hamesha aise hi ghusla (nested) hota hai.

Checkbox ka `checked` hi shart hai:

```javascript
function bhejo() {
