Agar tip kai logo me baantna ho to kul ko logo ki sankhya se bhaag do — ek aur input, ek aur line. Percent wala hisaab (bill × pct / 100) discount, GST, byaj — sab jagah yahi hai.

Plus (+) jodne ki jagah aaj ka saaf tareeka:

```javascript
let naam = 'Ravi';
let umar = 20;
let msg = `Namaste ${naam}, tumhari umar ${umar} saal hai`;
console.log(msg);
```

Backtick ( ` ) wali line me `${ }` ke andar koi bhi variable ya hisaab likh sakte ho. Lambi line banani ho to enter bhi de sakte ho — plus wale tareeke me ye nahi hota. HTML banane me bhi yahi sabse zyada chalta hai.

Data ko comma wali line me badal kar ek nakli link se download:

```javascript
function download() {
