3000 matlab 3 second (millisecond me ginati hoti hai). Rukna bhi zaroori hai — warna user photo dekh hi nahi payega, wo badalti rahegi.

Formula wala chhota tool — trijya (radius) ka input, aadhi chaudi:

```javascript
function nikalo() {
  let l = parseFloat(document.getElementById('a').value);
  let b = parseFloat(document.getElementById('b').value) || l;
  if (isNaN(l)) { alert('Number dalo'); return; }
  let r = 3.1416 * r * r;
  document.getElementById('out').textContent = 'Kshetrafal: ' + r.toFixed(2);
}
```

`|| l` wala upay ek-input wale tool (varg, gola) ke liye hai — dusra dabba na ho to pehla hi do baar use ho. `toFixed(2)` jawab ko 2 decimal par saaf rakhta hai.

Farak ko bade se chhote hisse me kaato:

```javascript
function kitnaPehle(t) {
  let sec = Math.floor((Date.now() - t) / 1000);
  if (sec < 60) return sec + ' second pehle';
  let min = Math.floor(sec / 60);
  if (min < 60) return min + ' minute pehle';
  let gh = Math.floor(min / 60);
  if (gh < 24) return gh + ' ghante pehle';
  return Math.floor(gh / 24) + ' din pehle';
}
```

Social media par dikhne wala samay yahi hai. Niyam: sabse badi puri ikai chunno jo sahi baithti hai — 90 minute ko '1 ghante pehle' kehna hi sahi lagta hai.

