`kul[h.shr]` — shreni ka naam hi chaabi (key) hai. `(kul[h.shr] || 0)` pehli baar us shreni ke liye 0 se shuru karta hai. Mahine ke aakhir me 'paisa gaya kahan' wala graph isi data se banta hai.

