Trick ye hai: data pehle ek **array** me rakho, screen usi se banti hai. Array badla → `save()` + `dikhao()`. `JSON.stringify` array ko text banakar save karta hai, `JSON.parse` wapas array banata hai. Ab browser band karke kholo, list waisi ki waisi milegi.

