Sawal ek array me rakho, ek-ek karke dikhao:

```javascript
let sawal = [
  { q: 'Bharat ki rajdhani?', o: ['Mumbai', 'Delhi', 'Kolkata', 'Chennai'], a: 1 },
  { q: 'Paani ka formula?', o: ['CO2', 'O2', 'H2O', 'NaCl'], a: 2 },
  { q: 'Suraj kis disha se ugta hai?', o: ['Paschim', 'Uttar', 'Purab', 'Dakshin'], a: 2 }
];
