```javascript
let sabzi = ['aalu', 'tamatar', 'pyaaz'];
let copy = sabzi.slice();
copy.push('bhindi');
console.log('Asal:', sabzi);   // waisi ki waisi
console.log('Copy:', copy);
```

`slice()` bina number diye puri list ki nakal banata hai. Ek hisse ki copy chahiye to `slice(0, 2)` — shuru se 2 number se pehle tak. Asal par kaam karna ho to splice, copy par kaam ho to slice.

Formula: cm ko 100 se bhaag:

```javascript
function badlo() {
  let v = parseFloat(document.getElementById('n').value);
  if (isNaN(v)) { alert('Number dalo'); return; }
  document.getElementById('out').textContent = 'Jawab: ' + (v / 100).toFixed(2);
}
```

`toFixed(2)` jawab ko 2 decimal par rokta hai warna 0.333333 wala lamba jawab ayega. Ikai badlo, formula badlo — converter taiyaar.

Note: ek kinara teen baar guna:

```javascript
function nikalo() {
  let l = parseFloat(document.getElementById('a').value);
  let b = parseFloat(document.getElementById('b').value) || l;
  if (isNaN(l)) { alert('Number dalo'); return; }
  document.getElementById('out').textContent = 'Jawab: ' + (l * l * l).toFixed(2);
}
```

Kshetrafal andar ki jagah ginata hai, paridhi kinare ki lambai — dono ke tool alag bante hain par dhacha ek hi hai.

Number ko naam se jodne wali list:

```javascript
let mahine = ['January', 'February', 'March', 'April', 'May', 'June',
  'July', 'August', 'September', 'October', 'November', 'December'];
let d = new Date();
console.log(mahine[d.getMonth()]);   // is mahine ka naam
```

`getMonth()` 0 deta hai January ke liye — list isiliye January se shuru hai, number aur jagah khud mil jate hain. Hindi mahine chahiye to bas list ke naam badal do.

```javascript
let naam = ['Ravi', 'Seema', 'Aman'];
let copy = naam.slice();
copy.push('Priya');
console.log('Asal:', naam);   // waisi ki waisi
console.log('Copy:', copy);
```

`slice()` bina number diye puri list ki nakal banata hai. Ek hisse ki copy chahiye to `slice(0, 2)` — shuru se 2 number se pehle tak. Asal par kaam karna ho to splice, copy par kaam ho to slice.

Wahi chhota-tool wala dhacha — input, formula, jawab:

```javascript
function nikalo() {
  let janm = parseFloat(document.getElementById('n').value);
  if (isNaN(janm)) { alert('Number dalo'); return; }
  let aaj = new Date();
  document.getElementById('out').textContent = 'Jawab: ' + Math.floor(aaj.getFullYear() - janm);
}
```

janm ka saal input me lo — formula badalte hi naya tool ban jata hai. `Math.floor` aadhe hisse ko neeche girakar pura number deta hai (umar 24.7 nahi, 24 saal).

Daam se percent kaatna:

```javascript
function nikalo() {
  let daam = parseFloat(document.getElementById('daam').value);
  let pct = parseFloat(document.getElementById('pct').value);
  if (isNaN(daam) || isNaN(pct)) { alert('Dono number dalo'); return; }
  let bacha = daam * pct / 100;
  document.getElementById('out').textContent =
    'Chhoot: ' + bacha + ' rupaye, Dene hain: ' + (daam - bacha) + ' rupaye';
}
```

Percent ka hisaab hamesha `rakam * pct / 100` hai. Dukaan par '40% off' dekh kar turant asal daam — ye tool har graahak ko pasand aata hai.

Interval 1000 ki jagah chhota rakho aur asal samay ka farak gino:

```javascript
let shuru = 0, chal = null;
function start() {
  shuru = Date.now();
  chal = setInterval(function() {
    let gaya = Date.now() - shuru;
    document.getElementById('time').textContent = (gaya / 1000).toFixed(2) + ' sec';
  }, 10);
}
function stop() { clearInterval(chal); }
```

Second ginate rahne se ghadi dheere-dheere peeche ho jati hai. `Date.now()` se asal farak ginna hamesha sahi rehta hai — bade stopwatch apps bhi yahi karte hain.

Scroll ka percent nikaal kar patti ki chaudai:

```javascript
window.addEventListener('scroll', function() {
  let kul = document.body.scrollHeight - window.innerHeight;
  let pct = window.scrollY / kul * 100;
  document.getElementById('patti').style.width = pct + '%';
});
```

Upar bandhi hui (fixed) patti jiski chaudai 0% se 100% hoti hai. Khabar/blog wali site par padhne ki raftaar dikhane ke liye ye khub chalta hai.

```javascript
let phal = ['aam', 'kela', 'seb'];
phal.splice(1, 1);              // 1 number se 1 item hataya
console.log(phal);
phal.splice(1, 0, 'angoor');      // 1 number par bina hataye joda
console.log(phal);
```

`splice(shuru, kitneHataye, ...jodnaHai)` — teen kaam ek me: hatana, jodna, badalna (hatakar jodna). Ye asal list ko badalta hai, isliye hosh se use karo.

```javascript
let sabzi = ['aalu', 'tamatar', 'pyaaz'];
sabzi.unshift('bhindi');   // shuru me joda
console.log(sabzi);
let pehla = sabzi.shift();  // shuru wala hataya
console.log('Hataya:', pehla);
```

Jodi yaad rakho: aakhir ke liye push/pop, shuru ke liye unshift/shift. Shuru wala kaam thoda dheema hota hai kyunki baaki sab ek-ek khisakte hain — badi list me aakhir wala tareeka behtar.

Note object me `pin: true` jodo aur dikhane se pehle pin wale aage rakho:

```javascript
function pinKaro(i) { notes[i].pin = !notes[i].pin; save(); dikhao(); }
function dikhao() {
  let lage = [...notes].sort(function(a, b) { return (b.pin ? 1 : 0) - (a.pin ? 1 : 0); });
  // lage wale order me screen banao
}
```

`sort` me pin wale ko aage dhakela gaya hai. `[...notes]` copy banata hai taaki asal order kharab na ho — sirf dikhawa badla, data nahi.

Do bhasha ke shabd ek object me:

```javascript
let shabd = {
  hi: { swagat: 'Namaste! Swagat hai', btn: 'Aage badho' },
  en: { swagat: 'Hello! Welcome', btn: 'Continue' }
};
function bhashaBadlo(b) {
  document.getElementById('swagat').textContent = shabd[b].swagat;
  document.getElementById('btn').textContent = shabd[b].btn;
  localStorage.setItem('bhasha', b);
}
```

Asli bade app me har shabd aise hi ek jagah rakha jata hai. Pasand localStorage me — agli baar page wahi bhasha me khulega.

```javascript
let user = { naam: 'Ravi', sheher: 'Delhi' };
let aur = { umar: 20, sheher: 'Mumbai' };
let dono = { ...user, ...aur };
console.log(dono);   // { naam: 'Ravi', sheher: 'Mumbai', umar: 20 }
```

Ek hi key dono me ho to **baad wala jeet-ta** hai (sheher Mumbai hua). Setting badalte samay 'purani setting + nayi setting' wala kaam isi se hota hai — asal object nahi badalta.

Button hata do, `input` event hi kaafi hai:

```javascript
document.getElementById('n').addEventListener('input', function() {
  let n = parseFloat(this.value);
  document.getElementById('out').textContent =
    isNaN(n) ? '' : 'Dugna: ' + (n * 2) + ' | Square: ' + (n * n);
});
```

User har akshar likhe aur jawab usi pal badle — ye anubhav bade apps jaisa lagta hai. Khali hone par `isNaN` dekh kar purana jawab hata do, warna NaN dikhega.

Do hifazat ek saath — `maxlength` aur number wala check:

```html
<input id="num" maxlength="10" inputmode="numeric" oninput="sirfNumber(this)">
```
```javascript
function sirfNumber(el) {
  el.value = el.value.replace(/[^0-9]/g, '');
}
```

`replace(/[^0-9]/g, '')` number ke alawa har akshar ko hata deta hai — '98a76' likha to '9876' rah jayega. `inputmode="numeric"` mobile par number wala keyboard kholta hai.

Text wala aasan rasta:

```javascript
function ulta() {
  let n = document.getElementById('n').value;
  document.getElementById('out').textContent = 'Ulta: ' + n.split('').reverse().join('');
}
```

Shabd ulta karne wala hi tareeka hai. Aakhir ke 0 ghumne par aage aa jayenge (1200 → 0021) — asal hisaab me wo 21 hi mana jayega, ye baat user ko bata dena achha hai.

```javascript
let phal = ['aam', 'kela', 'seb'];
let hata = phal.pop();
console.log('Hataya:', hata);
console.log(phal);
```

`pop` aakhri item ko nikal kar **wapas deta** hai — isliye use variable me pakda. List khali ho to pop `undefined` deta hai, error nahi.

Ghaat (power) wala formula:

```javascript
function nikalo() {
  let P = parseFloat(document.getElementById('p').value);
  let r = parseFloat(document.getElementById('r').value);
  let t = parseFloat(document.getElementById('t').value);
  let kul = P * Math.pow(1 + r / 100, t);
  document.getElementById('out').textContent =
    'Kul: ' + kul.toFixed(0) + ' rupaye (Byaj: ' + (kul - P).toFixed(0) + ')';
}
```

Sadharan byaj me byaj har saal ek jaisa, chakravriddhi me byaj par bhi byaj lagta hai — isliye samay ke saath ye tez badhta hai. FD/RD ke hisaab yahi hain.

Do input, ek taiyaar card:

```javascript
function banao() {
  let naam = document.getElementById('naam').value || 'Dost';
  let se = document.getElementById('se').value || 'Dost';
  document.getElementById('cardNaam').textContent = 'Janamdin Mubarak, ' + naam + '!';
  document.getElementById('cardSe').textContent = '— ' + se + ' ki taraf se';
}
```

Card ka design CSS se pehle se bana rakho (rang, kinare, badi akshar) — JS bas naam badalta hai. Yahi soch har 'apna naam dalo, design taiyaar' wale viral page ki hai.

Ho gaya wala kaam par line marna — click par class toggle karo:

```html
<style>
.hoGaya { text-decoration: line-through; color: gray; }
</style>
<ul id="list"></ul>
<script>
let li = document.createElement('li');
li.textContent = 'Email bhejna';
li.onclick = function() { this.classList.toggle('hoGaya'); };
document.getElementById('list').appendChild(li);
</script>
```

`classList.toggle('hoGaya')` ek click me class lagata hai, dusre click me hata deta hai. CSS ki `line-through` se task kata hua dikhta hai — jaise kagaz par pura kaam kaat dete hain.

Chunav ko ek shabd me save karo, khulte hi lagao:

```javascript
function themeBadlo(t) {
  document.body.className = t;
  localStorage.setItem('theme', t);
}
// page khulte hi:
document.body.className = localStorage.getItem('theme') || 'light';
```

`|| 'light'` ka matlab: kuch save na ho (pehli baar) to light maan lo. Yahi soch har 'pasand yaad rakho' wale kaam me hai — bhasha, rang, sheher — sab aise hi yaad rehte hain.

Ek jhanda (flag) rakho:

```javascript
if (!localStorage.getItem('pehliBaar')) {
  alert('Namaste! Pehli baar aaye ho, swagat hai');
  localStorage.setItem('pehliBaar', 'ha');
}
```

`getItem` na mile to `null` aata hai — wahi pehli baar ki pehchan hai. Yahi tareeka 'sandesh padh liya', 'niyam dekh liye' — har ek-baar-wale kaam me chalta hai.

`mouseenter` par nayi photo, `mouseleave` par purani:

```javascript
let img = document.getElementById('photo');
img.addEventListener('mouseenter', function() { img.src = 'photo2.jpg'; });
img.addEventListener('mouseleave', function() { img.src = 'photo1.jpg'; });
```

Dukaan wali websites par kapdo ke rang aise hi badalte dikhaye jate hain. Mobile par hover nahi hota (ungli ghumti nahi, tap hota hai) — isliye asal jaankari sirf hover par mat rakho.

Computer ki ginati 1000 par nahi, 1024 par chalti hai:

```javascript
function badlo() {
  let mb = parseFloat(document.getElementById('n').value);
  if (isNaN(mb)) { alert('Number dalo'); return; }
  document.getElementById('out').textContent = mb + ' MB = ' + (mb / 1024).toFixed(2) + ' GB';
}
```

1024 MB = 1 GB, 1024 GB = 1 TB. Isiliye 512 GB wala phone khali dabbe par kam dikhata hai — hisaab ka yehi farak hai.

8 glass ka lakshya, har click ek glass:

```javascript
let glass = parseInt(localStorage.getItem('paani') || '0');
function dikhao() {
  document.getElementById('gin').textContent = glass + ' / 8 glass';
  document.getElementById('patti').style.width = (glass / 8 * 100) + '%';
}
function piya() { if (glass < 8) { glass++; localStorage.setItem('paani', glass); dikhao(); } }
dikhao();
```

Patti (progress bar) ginati ke hisaab se bharti hai — dikhne wala badlav hi aadmi ko aage badhata hai. Din badalne par ginati nayi karne ke liye tareekh bhi saath save kar sakte ho.

`map` ke dusre hisse — number (index) ka istemal:

```javascript
let kaam = ['Doodh', 'Padhai', 'Safai'];
document.getElementById('list').innerHTML = kaam.map(function(k, i) {
  return '<li>' + (i + 1) + '. ' + k + '</li>';
}).join('');
```

Map ka function do cheez pata hai — item aur uska number. Number 0 se shuru hota hai isliye dikhane ke liye +1. Yahi number delete/edit ke button me bhi kaam aata hai.

Number ko text bana kar har ank:

```javascript
function nikalo() {
  let n = document.getElementById('n').value;
  let jod = 0;
  for (let ch of n) { if (!isNaN(parseInt(ch))) jod += parseInt(ch); }
  document.getElementById('out').textContent = 'Anko ka jod: ' + jod;
}
```

`for...of` text ke har akshar par ghumta hai. Text roop me lene se bade number bhi asaan hain — hisaab wale tareeke (% 10) se ye seekhne me zyada saaf hai.

Formula: F = C × 9/5 + 32

```javascript
function badlo() {
  let c = parseFloat(document.getElementById('c').value);
  if (isNaN(c)) { alert('Pehle number dalo'); return; }
  document.getElementById('out').textContent = c + '°C = ' + (c * 9 / 5 + 32).toFixed(1) + '°F';
}
```

Ulta chahiye (F se C) to formula ulta: `(f - 32) * 5 / 9`. Aise badalne wale tool (converter) har tarah ke bante hain — km-mile, kg-pound — bas formula badalta hai, dhacha nahi.

Jeet ke niyam ek function me:

```javascript
function kaunJeeta(hum, comp) {
  if (hum === comp) return 'Barabar';
  if ((hum === 'patthar' && comp === 'kainchi') ||
      (hum === 'kagaz' && comp === 'patthar') ||
      (hum === 'kainchi' && comp === 'kagaz')) return 'Tum jeete';
  return 'Computer jeeta';
}
let comp = ['patthar', 'kagaz', 'kainchi'][Math.floor(Math.random() * 3)];
```

Computer ka chunav list se random number wala purana tareeka hai. Niyam saaf likhne se galti nahi hoti — har jeet wali jodi ek line me.

Dblclick par padhne wala dabba likhne wala ban jaye:

```javascript
document.getElementById('note').addEventListener('dblclick', function() {
  let purana = this.textContent;
  let naya = prompt('Badlo:', purana);
  if (naya !== null && naya !== '') this.textContent = naya;
});
```

`prompt` chhota input dabba deta hai — practice ke liye thik hai. `null` ka matlab user ne Cancel dabaya, tab purana hi rehne do.

Ek input, ek formula (gram ko 1000 se bhaag):

```javascript
function badlo() {
  let v = parseFloat(document.getElementById('n').value);
  if (isNaN(v)) { alert('Number dalo'); return; }
  document.getElementById('out').textContent = 'Jawab: ' + (v / 1000);
}
```

Saare converter ek hi dhache ke hain — input lo, jaancho, formula lagao, dikhao. Formula badlo, naya tool taiyaar. Jawab me ikai (unit) ka naam bhi likh do to user ko aur saaf samajh ayega.

Ek button, ek line:

```javascript
function rangBadlo() {
  document.body.style.backgroundColor = 'neela';
}
```

Button par `onclick="rangBadlo()"` lagao. Chaar rang ke chaar button banana ho to ek hi function me rang bhej do: `onclick="rang('neela')"` aur `function rang(r) { document.body.style.backgroundColor = r; }` — ek function, kai button, yahi sahi aadat hai.

Ek hi sunne wala kai button ke liye:

```javascript
document.getElementById('dabba').addEventListener('click', function(e) {
  if (e.target.tagName === 'BUTTON') {
    alert('Daba gaya: ' + e.target.textContent);
  }
});
```

`e.target` wahi element hai jispar asal click hua. Bade dabbe par ek listener lagakar andar ke saare button sambhalna 'event delegation' kahlata hai — list me naye button aaye to bhi kaam karta hai, alag se listener nahi lagana padta.

Note ko sirf text ki jagah object banao — text + samay:

```javascript
function jodo() {
  let v = document.getElementById('txt').value;
  if (v === '') return;
  let d = new Date();
  notes.push({ text: v, time: d.getDate() + '/' + (d.getMonth() + 1) + ' ' + d.getHours() + ':' + d.getMinutes() });
  save(); dikhao();
}
```

Dikhane par `n.text` aur neeche chhoti si `n.time` print karo. Object me rakhne se baad me title, rang, pin — kuch bhi jodna aasan ho jata hai.

24 ghante ko 12 me badalne ka hisaab:

```javascript
function ghadi() {
  let d = new Date();
  let h = d.getHours();
  let ap = h >= 12 ? 'PM' : 'AM';
  h = h % 12; if (h === 0) h = 12;
  let m = String(d.getMinutes()).padStart(2, '0');
  document.getElementById('time').textContent = h + ':' + m + ' ' + ap;
}
setInterval(ghadi, 1000); ghadi();
```

`h % 12` 13 ko 1, 23 ko 11 banata hai. 0 aane par (aadhi raat) 12 dikhana sahi hota hai, isliye wo alag check hai.

`Date` se din-mahina bhi milta hai, bas naam wali list chahiye:

```javascript
let din = ['Ravivar', 'Somvar', 'Mangalvar', 'Budhvar', 'Guruvar', 'Shukravar', 'Shanivar'];
let d = new Date();
document.getElementById('date').textContent =
  din[d.getDay()] + ', ' + d.getDate() + '/' + (d.getMonth() + 1) + '/' + d.getFullYear();
```

`getDay()` 0-6 deta hai (0 = Ravivar), isliye dinon ki list Ravivar se shuru rakhi. `getMonth()` bhi 0 se shuru hota hai, isliye +1 kiya.

```javascript
let sandesh = '  namaste dost  ';
console.log(sandesh.trim());
```

Form me user aksar galti se aage-peeche space de deta hai — bina `trim` ke password/email ki tulna fail ho jati hai ('ravi ' aur 'ravi' alag mane jate hain). Har input ko pehle trim karna achhi aadat hai. Sirf ek taraf saaf karna ho to `trimStart` / `trimEnd`.

HTML me likhi khasiyat (attribute) ko JS se badalna:

```javascript
let img = document.getElementById('photo');
img.setAttribute('src', 'nayi.jpg');
console.log(img.getAttribute('src'));
img.removeAttribute('title');
```

Aam attribute ke liye seedha tareeka bhi hai: `img.src = 'nayi.jpg'`, `link.href = '...'`, `inp.value = '...'` — wahi kaam chhota likha jata hai. `setAttribute` tab kaam aata hai jab attribute ka naam badalta ho ya data-* jaisa khaas ho.

Sawal ek saaf format me rakho — har sawal ek object:

```javascript
let sawal = [
  { q: 'Paudhe khana kaise banate hain us kriya ka naam?', o: ['Option A', 'Option B', 'Option C', 'Option D'], a: 0 },
  { q: 'Apna dusra sawal yahan', o: ['A', 'B', 'C', 'D'], a: 2 }
];
```

`a` hamesha sahi option ka **number** hai aur ginati 0 se shuru hoti hai (pehla option = 0). science ke sawal isiliye array me rakhte hain taaki sawal badalna ya badhana bina code chhede ho — data alag, chalane wala code alag.

Password match wala hi tareeka, email par:

```javascript
function check() {
  let a = document.getElementById('e1').value.trim().toLowerCase();
  let b = document.getElementById('e2').value.trim().toLowerCase();
  document.getElementById('msg').textContent =
