Email me bade-chhote akshar ka farak nahi padta, isliye tulna se pehle dono ko `toLowerCase` kiya. `trim` aage-peeche ki galat space bhi saaf kar deta hai.

Har badlav par nishaane se jaanch:

```javascript
function dikhao() {
  document.getElementById('num').textContent = n;
  if (n === 100 || n === 500 || n === 1000) {
    document.getElementById('msg').textContent = 'Badhai ho! ' + n + ' pure hue';
  }
}
```

`||` ka matlab 'ya' — koi ek bhi mile to sandesh. Ginati aage badh jane par sandesh hatana ho to else me khali kar do.

Table ke chaaro taraf ek scroll wala dabba:

```css
.tableDabba { overflow-x: auto; }
table { min-width: 500px; border-collapse: collapse; }
```

Chaudai zyada ho to table page ko nahi todti — apne dabbe ke andar dayein-bayein ghumti hai. Page pura ghumne se ye hamesha behtar hai. Table wale har page par ye 2 line lagana aadat bana lo.

Har entry ek object — naam, rakam, prakar (aaya/gaya):

```javascript
let hisaab = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('hisaab') || '[]');
function jodo() {
  let naam = document.getElementById('naam').value;
  let rakam = parseFloat(document.getElementById('rakam').value);
  let prakar = document.getElementById('prakar').value; // 'aaya' ya 'gaya'
  if (naam === '' || isNaN(rakam)) return;
  hisaab.push({ naam: naam, rakam: rakam, prakar: prakar });
  localStorage.setItem('hisaab', JSON.stringify(hisaab));
  dikhao();
}
function dikhao() {
  let aaya = 0, gaya = 0;
  hisaab.forEach(function(h) { if (h.prakar === 'aaya') aaya += h.rakam; else gaya += h.rakam; });
  document.getElementById('kul').textContent = 'Aaya: ' + aaya + ' | Gaya: ' + gaya + ' | Bacha: ' + (aaya - gaya);
}
```

`forEach` se poori list ghoom kar kul aaya-gaya alag jama hota hai. Yahi hisaab asal kharcha apps ki neev hai.

Delete ke baad wahi `dikhao()` jo kul bhi ginata hai:

```javascript
function hatao(i) {
  hisaab.splice(i, 1);
  localStorage.setItem('hisaab', JSON.stringify(hisaab));
  dikhao();
}
```

Seekhne ki baat: delete ka alag hisaab kabhi mat likho — data badlo, save karo, screen dobara banao. Ek hi `dikhao()` add par bhi, delete par bhi — hisaab kabhi purana nahi rahega.

Photo ki list, ek number, do button:

```javascript
let photos = ['p1.jpg', 'p2.jpg', 'p3.jpg'];
let ab = 0;
function dikhao() { document.getElementById('img').src = photos[ab]; }
function aage() { ab = (ab + 1) % photos.length; dikhao(); }
function peeche() { ab = (ab - 1 + photos.length) % photos.length; dikhao(); }
dikhao();
```

`% photos.length` wala hisaab number ko ghumata hai — aakhri photo ke baad phir pehli. Peeche me `+ photos.length` isliye taaki number minus me na jaye.

Script agar head me hai to element abhi bane hi nahi honge:

```javascript
document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {
  document.getElementById('msg').textContent = 'Page taiyaar hai';
});
```

Ye event kehta hai 'HTML pura ban gaya, ab element pakdo'. Iske bina `getElementById` ko element nahi milega aur `null` par kaam karne se error ayega. Script ko body ke aakhir me rakhna bhi iska ek hal hai.

`find` pehla milne wala item deta hai:

```javascript
let log = [
  { naam: 'Ravi', umar: 20 }, { naam: 'Seema', umar: 25 }
];
let mila = log.find(function(x) { return x.naam === 'Seema'; });
console.log(mila.umar);  // 25
```

Na mile to `find` `undefined` deta hai — isliye aage badhne se pehle `if (mila)` check karo. Sirf haan/na chahiye to `some` hai: `log.some(x => x.umar > 24)` true dega.

Save ko try-catch me lapeto:

```javascript
function save() {
  try {
    localStorage.setItem('notes', JSON.stringify(notes));
  } catch (e) {
    alert('Save nahi ho paya — browser ki jagah bhari ho sakti hai');
  }
}
```

Private mode me ya jagah (lagbhag 5 MB) bhar jane par `setItem` error phenkta hai. Bina try-catch ke wahi error pura code rok dega; isse sirf save rukega, app chalti rahegi.

Score ko percent me badal kar card:

```javascript
function khatam() {
  let pct = Math.round(score / sawal.length * 100);
  let grade = pct >= 80 ? 'A' : pct >= 60 ? 'B' : pct >= 40 ? 'C' : 'Aur practice karo';
  document.getElementById('q').textContent = 'Result: ' + pct + '% — ' + grade;
  document.getElementById('opts').innerHTML = '<button onclick="phirSe()">Phir se khelo</button>';
}
```

`Math.round` percent ko pura number banata hai (83.333 wala nahi dikhega). Restart ka button result ke saath hi dena sabse sahi jagah hai.

Edit par purana text input me wapas bharo aur save par wahi index badlo:

```javascript
let editWala = -1;
function editKaro(i) {
  document.getElementById('inp').value = kaam[i];
  editWala = i;
  document.getElementById('inp').focus();
}
function jodo() {
  let v = document.getElementById('inp').value;
  if (v === '') return;
  if (editWala >= 0) { kaam[editWala] = v; editWala = -1; }
  else kaam.push(v);
  save(); dikhao();
  document.getElementById('inp').value = '';
}
```

`editWala` yaad rakhta hai kaun sa number edit ho raha hai. -1 matlab naya add ho raha hai. Ye chhota sa tarika bade apps me bhi yahi chalta hai.

Har achhi khoobi ke liye ek ank dena hai — kul ank hi mazbooti batayenge:

```python
password = input("Password likho: ")

ank = 0
if len(password) >= 8:
    ank += 1
if any(c.isdigit() for c in password):
    ank += 1
if any(c.isupper() for c in password):
    ank += 1
if any(c in "!@#$%^&*" for c in password):
    ank += 1

if ank <= 1:
    print("Kamzor password")
elif ank <= 3:
    print("Theek-thaak password")
else:
    print("Mazboot password")
```

`any()` kisi bhi ek akshar ke liye shart sach hai ya nahi, ye batata hai. Asli mazbooti lambai se sabse zyada badhti hai — 12+ akshar ka password chhote par jatil password se behtar hota hai.

Delete wala kaam hamesha pehle dikhakar, phir anumati lekar karna chahiye:

```python
import os

folder = "MeraFolder"
faltu = (".tmp", ".log")

for file in os.listdir(folder):
    if file.lower().endswith(faltu):
        print("Milegi:", file)

jawab = input("Kya inhe hatana hai? (ha/na): ")
if jawab.lower() == "ha":
    for file in os.listdir(folder):
        if file.lower().endswith(faltu):
            os.remove(os.path.join(folder, file))
    print("Safai ho gayi")
```

Ye do kadam wala tareeka surakshit hai — pehle soochi, phir 'ha' mile tabhi `os.remove`. Ek baar hati file Python se wapas nahi aati, isliye ye savdhaani zaroori hai.
